WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.320
 I'll have you know I make a mean cocktail. Whiskey? That's kind of boring. Alright.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:17.760
 On the rocks? Well, that's a weird request, but sure, okay.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.480
 Let's just pour.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.400
 Hmm, and all the rocks, okay.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:40.400
 Hmm, this is what you wanted?

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.280
 Whiskey with rocks.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:53.220
 Let me just taste test it for you.
